		default y if DEFAULT_midisport-firmware
		default m if ALL
		select PACKAGE_fxload
		select PACKAGE_libc
		help
		 This package allows you to use the MidiSport USB MIDI interfaces from
		 M-Audio/Midiman.
		 
		 Supported devices:
		 - MidiSport 1x1
		 - MidiSport 2x2
		 - MidiSport 4x4
		 - MidiSport 8x8
		 - MidiSport Uno
		 - Keystation
		 - Oxygen
		 - Radium
		 
		 (You don't need a firmware download for the USB Audio Quattro, Duo, or
		 MidiSport 2x4.)
		 https://sourceforge.net/projects/usb-midi-fw
		 Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>

