		help
		 High-level C binding for ZeroMQ which is high-performance asynchronous messaging
		   library, aimed at use in distributed or concurrent applications.
		 http://czmq.zeromq.org
		 Jan Pavlinec <jan.pavlinec1@gmail.com>

