		select PACKAGE_libc
		help
		 nginx is an HTTP and reverse proxy server, as well as a mail proxy server, written by Igor Sysoev. This variant is compiled with ALL module selected.
		 http://nginx.org/
		 Thomas Heil <heil@terminal-consulting.de> Ansuel Smith <ansuelsmth@gmail.com>

