		 MariaDB is a very fast and robust SQL database server.
		 
		 This package includes the following extra server binaries:
		 
		 aria_chk
		 aria_dump_log
		 aria_ftdump
		 aria_pack
		 aria_read_log
		 mariabackup
		 myisam_ftdump
		 myisamchk
		 myisamlog
		 myisampack
		 mysql_convert_table_format
		 mysql_fix_extensions
		 mysql_secure_installation
		 mysql_setpermission
		 mysql_tzinfo_to_sql
		 mysqld_multi
		 mysqld_safe
		 mysqld_safe_helper
		 mysqldumpslow
		 mysqlhotcopy
		 perror
		 replace
		 resolve_stack_dump
		 wsrep_sst_mariabackup
		 wsrep_sst_mysqldump
		 wsrep_sst_rsync
		 wsrep_sst_rsync_wan
		 
		 https://mariadb.org/
		 Michal Hrusecky <Michal@Hrusecky.net>

