	menuconfig PACKAGE_iozone
		tristate "iozone................................. IOzone file system benchmark tool"
		default y if DEFAULT_iozone
		default m if ALL
		select PACKAGE_librt
		select PACKAGE_libpthread
		select PACKAGE_libc
		help
		 IOzone is a filesystem benchmark tool. The benchmark generates and measures a variety of file operations. The benchmark tests file, I/O performance for the operations like Read, write, re-read, re-write, read backwards, read strided, fread, fwrite, random read, pread ,mmap, aio_read, aio_write.
		 http://www.iozone.org/
		 

	config PACKAGE_ipcs
		tristate "ipcs.................................. show information on IPC facilities"
		default y if DEFAULT_ipcs
		default m if ALL
		select PACKAGE_librt
		select PACKAGE_libc
		help
		 ipcs shows information on the inter-process communication facilities for
		   which the calling process has read access. By default it shows information
		   about all three resources: shared memory segments, message queues, and
		   semaphore arrays.
		 http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/util-linux/
		 

	config PACKAGE_irqbalance
