		 Convert text files with DOS or Mac line breaks to Unix line breaks
		   and vice versa.
		 
		   This package contains the unix2dos.
		 https://waterlan.home.xs4all.nl/dos2unix.html
		 Tianling Shen <cnsztl@immortalwrt.org>

